  "Question": "Circle \\(O\\) has radius 5. Point \\(P\\) lies outside circle \\(O\\), and the shortest distance from \\(P\\) to a point on circle \\(O\\) is 3. Find the longest distance from \\(P\\) to a point on circle \\(O\\).",
